---
/** @lang zh-CN 版本说明只呈现真实预览，未来封版规则不生成虚构历史版本。 @lang en Version information shows the actual preview and retention policy without inventing archived releases. */
import { href } from "../lib/routes.mjs";
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === "en";
const text = (zh: string, english: string) => en ? english : zh;
---
<p class="eyebrow">Documentation versions</p><h1>{text("版本与封版", "Versions and archives")}</h1><p class="lede">{text("最新版持续更新，旧大版本各保留一份最后封版。", "Main documentation stays current; each older major retains one final edition.")}</p><h2 id="current">{text("当前文档", "Current documentation")}</h2><div class="card"><span class="pill blue">{text("1.0.0 预览", "1.0.0 preview")}</span><h2>{text("正式初版正在准备中", "The first formal release is in preparation")}</h2><p>{text("系统尚未正式发布1.0.0。包归档、源码候选与工件契约有各自版本，不能互相替代。", "System 1.0.0 has not been formally released. Package archives, source candidates, and artifact contracts have separate version identities.")}</p><a href={href("docs", locale, import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="card-footer">{text("进入当前预览 →", "Open current preview →")}</a></div><h2 id="archives">{text("历史封版", "Archives")}</h2><div class="empty"><strong>{text("暂无历史大版本封版", "No archived major versions yet")}</strong><p>{text("将来进入新大版本后，在此保留旧大版本最后一版。", "When a new major becomes current, the previous major's final edition will be retained here.")}</p></div><h2 id="policy">{text("保留与切换规则", "Retention and switching")}</h2><p>{text("正式发布后主文档跟随最新稳定版，每个旧大版本只保留最后一版。版本下拉为主要入口，历史总页为辅助入口。", "After formal release, main documentation follows the latest stable version and each older major retains only its final edition. The version dropdown is the primary entry, with the history page as a secondary entry.")}</p><p>{text("切换优先保留同语言、同主题。目标缺少主题或译文时明确说明，并提供目标版本目录与返回原主题的入口，不静默跳回最新版。", "Switching should preserve language and topic. Missing topics or translations require an explicit message, a target-version directory, and a return link rather than silently switching to the latest version.")}</p>
